/-!
# Descent-channel assembly of the Mathlib t-structure

This file assembles Mathlib's `TStructure` record from the null-homotopy
truncation route and the named descent-channel numerator-cancellation route for
orthogonality.
-/

noncomputable section

namespace Boundary
